      "description": "The lit table surface; a meld your selection can extend turns gold-bordered.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-felt\"><p class=\"ds-banner\"><span>À vous</span> · piochez</p><button class=\"ds-meld\"><span class=\"ds-mini\">7♥</span><span class=\"ds-mini\">8♥</span><span class=\"ds-mini\">9♥</span></button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-felt{background:radial-gradient(ellipse at center,#1f5d3a,#143f27);border:6px solid #3a2a16;border-radius:40px;padding:16px 20px;box-shadow:inset 0 0 40px rgba(0,0,0,.4)}.ds-banner{margin:0 0 10px;color:#dfeee4}.ds-banner span{color:#f2cd72}.ds-meld{display:flex;gap:4px;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(0,0,0,.18);border:1px solid #e6b84f;cursor:pointer;color:inherit}.ds-meld:hover{background:rgba(230,184,79,.15)}.ds-meld:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #e6b84f;outline-offset:2px}.ds-mini{background:#fdfdf8;color:#c8322b;border-radius:5px;padding:6px 5px;font-weight:700;font-size:13px}"
